# Cursor AI Rules for Xala/Digilist Platform

## CRITICAL: i18n Localization-First Rule

**NEVER use hardcoded strings in UI components. ALL user-facing text MUST use the i18n system.**

### Mandatory Pattern
```tsx
// ❌ FORBIDDEN - Hardcoded strings
<Heading>Settings</Heading>
<Button>Save Changes</Button>
<Input placeholder="Enter your name" />

// ✅ REQUIRED - Use t() for all text
import { useT } from '@xala/i18n';

function Component() {
  const t = useT();
  return (
    <>
      <Heading>{t('settings.title')}</Heading>
      <Button>{t('common.saveChanges')}</Button>
      <Input placeholder={t('profile.namePlaceholder')} />
    </>
  );
}
```

### When Adding New UI Text

1. Add translations to BOTH:
   - packages/i18n/src/locales/nb.ts (Norwegian)
   - packages/i18n/src/locales/en.ts (English)

2. Rebuild i18n: pnpm -F @xala/i18n build

3. Run scanner before committing: node scripts/scan-i18n.js apps/minside/src

### Key Naming Convention
- common.* - Shared strings
- auth.* - Authentication
- nav.* - Navigation
- [page].* - Page-specific
- [component].* - Component-specific

## Test Organization (REQUIRED)

All tests MUST be organized under `tests/`:
- tests/unit/ - Vitest unit tests
- tests/e2e/ - Playwright E2E tests
- tests/integration/ - Integration tests
- tests/reports/ - All test output (gitignored)

**NEVER create test folders at root level** (test-results/, playwright-report/, reports/)

## Documentation Organization (REQUIRED)

All documentation MUST be organized under `docs/`:
- docs/architecture/ - Architecture docs and proposals
- docs/guides/ - Development guides
- docs/operations/deployments/ - Deployment reports
- docs/operations/migrations/ - Migration reports
- docs/operations/archive/ - Historical artifacts

**CRITICAL RULES:**
- **NEVER create documentation files in the repository root**
- **NEVER create documentation in reports/ folder**
- All new documentation MUST go in appropriate docs/ subdirectories

**Exceptions (ONLY these files allowed in root):**
- README.md, AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, AI_RULES.md

## Other Critical Rules

### SDK-First: ONLY use @digilist/client-sdk (never fetch/axios)
### Design System: ONLY import from @xala/ds (never @digdir/*)
### No Transformers: Use SDK Projection DTOs directly
### No Hardcoded Values: Use design tokens

See CLAUDE.md for complete guidelines.
